248	\N	\N	2026-11-17 08:21:19.290421	1	https://www.odoo.com/documentation/latest/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.html	{"en_US": ""}	l10n_it	OpenERP Italian Community	/base/static/description/icon.png	uninstalled	\N	{"en_US": "Italy - Accounting", "es_ES": "Italia - Contabilidad"}	37	{"en_US": "\\nPiano dei conti italiano di un'impresa generica.\\n================================================\\n\\nItalian accounting chart and localization.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nPiano dei conti italiano di un'impresa generica.\\n================================================\\n\\nPlan contable y localización de Italia.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N				official	\N
