503	\N	\N	2026-11-17 08:21:19.290421	1		{"en_US": ""}	resource	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.1	{"en_US": "Resource", "es_ES": "Recurso"}	4	{"en_US": "\\nModule for resource management.\\n===============================\\n\\nA resource represent something that can be scheduled (a developer on a task or a\\nwork center on manufacturing orders). This module manages a resource calendar\\nassociated to every resource. It also manages the leaves of every resource.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nMódulo para la gestión de recursos.\\n===============================\\n\\nUn recurso representa algo que se puede planificar (un desarrollador en una tarea o un centro de trabajo en una orden de fabricación). Este módulo gestiona un calendario asociado a cada recurso. También gestiona las ausencias de cada recurso.\\n"}	f	t	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Settings/Technical/Resource\nSettings/Technical/Resource/Resource Time Off\nSettings/Technical/Resource/Resources\nSettings/Technical/Resource/Working Schedules		* INHERIT res.company.form.inherit.resource (form)\nresource.calendar.attendance.form (form)\nresource.calendar.attendance.list (list)\nresource.calendar.form (form)\nresource.calendar.leaves.calendar (calendar)\nresource.calendar.leaves.form (form)\nresource.calendar.leaves.list (list)\nresource.calendar.leaves.search (search)\nresource.calendar.list (list)\nresource.calendar.search (search)\nresource.resource.form (form)\nresource.resource.list (list)\nresource.resource.search (search)	official	\N
422	\N	\N	2026-11-17 08:21:19.290421	1		{"en_US": "Validate and format phone numbers", "es_ES": "Valide y formatee los números de teléfono"}	phone_validation	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.2.1	{"en_US": "Phone Numbers Validation", "es_ES": "Validación de números de teléfono"}	4	{"en_US": "\\nPhone Numbers Validation\\n========================\\n\\nThis module adds the feature of validation and formatting phone numbers\\naccording to a destination country.\\n\\nIt also adds phone blacklist management through a specific model storing\\nblacklisted phone numbers.\\n\\nIt adds mail.thread.phone mixin that handles sanitation and blacklist of\\nrecords numbers. ", "es_ES": "\\nValidación de números telefónicos\\n========================\\n\\nEste módulo añade la función de validación y formato de números de teléfono\\nsegún un país de destino.\\n\\nTambién añade la gestión de listas de exclusión de teléfonos a través de un modelo específico que almacena\\nnúmeros de teléfono en la lista de exclusión.\\n\\nAñade mail.thread.phone para gestionar la depuración y la lista negra de números de registros. "}	f	t	f	LGPL-3	9999	t	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Settings/Technical/Phone / SMS\nSettings/Technical/Phone / SMS/Phone Blacklist		* INHERIT res.partner.view.search.inherit.phone.validation (search)\nphone.blacklist.remove.form (form)\nphone.blacklist.view.form (form)\nphone.blacklist.view.list (list)\nphone.blacklist.view.search (search)	official	\N
