704	16	\N	1	1	payment.capture.wizard.form	payment.capture.wizard	\N	form	payment/wizards/payment_capture_wizard_views.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<form string=\\"Capture\\">\\n                <field name=\\"transaction_ids\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"is_amount_to_capture_valid\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"currency_id\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"support_partial_capture\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"has_draft_children\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"has_remaining_amount\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <div id=\\"alert_draft_capture_tx\\" role=\\"alert\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning\\" invisible=\\"not has_draft_children\\">\\n                    <strong>Warning!</strong> There is a partial capture pending. Please wait a\\n                    moment for it to be processed. Check your payment provider configuration if\\n                    the capture is still pending after a few minutes.\\n                </div>\\n                <group name=\\"readonly_fields\\">\\n                    <field name=\\"authorized_amount\\"/>\\n                    <field name=\\"captured_amount\\" invisible=\\"captured_amount &lt;= 0\\"/>\\n                    <field name=\\"voided_amount\\" invisible=\\"voided_amount &lt;= 0\\"/>\\n                </group>\\n                <hr/>\\n                <group name=\\"input_fields\\">\\n                    <label for=\\"amount_to_capture\\" class=\\"oe_inline\\"/>\\n                    <div class=\\"o_row\\">\\n                        <field name=\\"amount_to_capture\\" class=\\"oe_inline\\" readonly=\\"support_partial_capture == 'full_only'\\"/>\\n                        <i class=\\"fa fa-info-circle oe_inline\\" invisible=\\"support_partial_capture != 'full_only'\\" title=\\"Some of the transactions you intend to capture can only be captured in full. Handle the transactions individually to capture a partial amount.\\"/>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <field name=\\"void_remaining_amount\\" readonly=\\"not has_remaining_amount\\"/>\\n                </group>\\n                <div id=\\"alert_amount_to_capture_above_authorized_amount\\" role=\\"alert\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning mb-2\\" invisible=\\"is_amount_to_capture_valid\\">\\n                    <strong>Warning!</strong> You can not capture a negative amount nor more\\n                    than <field name=\\"available_amount\\" class=\\"oe_inline\\" widget=\\"monetary\\"/>.\\n                </div>\\n                <footer>\\n                    <button string=\\"Capture\\" type=\\"object\\" name=\\"action_capture\\" class=\\"btn-primary\\"/>\\n                    <button string=\\"Close\\" special=\\"cancel\\" class=\\"btn-secondary\\"/>\\n                </footer>\\n            </form>", "es_ES": "<form string=\\"Capturar\\">\\n                <field name=\\"transaction_ids\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"is_amount_to_capture_valid\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"currency_id\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"support_partial_capture\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"has_draft_children\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <field name=\\"has_remaining_amount\\" invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n                <div id=\\"alert_draft_capture_tx\\" role=\\"alert\\" class=\\"alert alert-warning\\" invisible=\\"not has_draft_children\\">\\n                    <strong>¡Advertencia!</strong> Hay una captura parcial pendiente. Espere\\n                    un momento para que se procese. Revise la configuración del pago de su proveedor si\\n                    la captura aún está pendiente después de unos minutos.\\n                </div>\\n                <group name=\\"readonly_fields\\">\\n                    <field name=\\"authorized_amount\\"/>\\n                    <field name=\\"captured_amount\\" invisible=