19	\N	3	\N	\N	1	\N	6	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	\N	<023927713737961.1794902884.745926380157471-openerp-3-discuss.channel@a19f070f70d4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>Selling a training session and selling the products after the training session is more efficient than directly selling a pack with the training session and the products.</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-11-12 08:08:00	\N	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932
20	\N	3	\N	\N	1	\N	2	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"OdooBot" <odoobot@example.com>	\N	\N	<993213130761553.1794902884.751102924346924-openerp-3-discuss.channel@a19f070f70d4>	"OdooBot" <odoobot@example.com>	\N	<p>I noted I can not manage efficiently my pipeline when I have more than 50 opportunities in the qualification stage.</p><p>Any advice on this? How do you organize your activities with more than 50 opportunities?</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-11-13 08:08:00	\N	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932
21	20	3	\N	\N	1	\N	6	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	\N	<821166547059461.1794902884.754597663879395-openerp-3-discuss.channel@a19f070f70d4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>When I have too much opportunities in the pipe, I start communicating with prospects more by email than phonecalls.</p><p>I send an email to create a sense of emergency, like <i>"can I call you this week about our quote?"</i> and I call only those that answer this email.</p><p>You can use the email template feature of Odoo to automate email composition.</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-11-14 08:08:00	\N	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932
22	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	6	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	\N	<262729562863285.1794902884.758540391921997-openerp-1-discuss.channel@a19f070f70d4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>\n    Great news!<br>\n    Our company has received the Deloitte Fast 50 award.  We are the fastest\n    growing company of the country, with a growth of 1549% over the past 5\n    years. You can get more information <a href="http://www.openerp.com/node/1244/2012/10">on our blog</a>.\n</p>\n	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-11-17 07:46:00	\N	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932
23	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	6	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	\N	<779154060205201.1794902884.762051582336426-openerp-1-discuss.channel@a19f070f70d4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>Your monthly meal vouchers arrived. You can get them at the HR's office.</p>\n<p>This month you also get 250 EUR of eco-vouchers if you have been in the company for more than a year.</p>	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-11-17 07:08:00	\N	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932	2026-11-17 08:08:01.052932
